# Architecture Patterns

## Backend Structure
- Organize features into separate routers in `/endpoints/` directory
- Middleware order: Settings refresh → logging → CORS
- Use FastAPI dependency injection with Depends()
- Use Pydantic models for all API interfaces

## Frontend Structure  
- Use Zustand for global state, React state for local component state
- Keep React components focused and single-purpose
- Separate logic (hooks) from presentation (components)
- Use axios for API calls with consistent loading/error handling
